Small modifications (still Perseus-derived; the MIT grant covers only the
lines actually added or changed by Dan Meany, not the surrounding code):
  - sv_pdl/settings.py                    (added STATICFILES_DIRS entry,
                                           localdict + localcomm apps)
  - sv_pdl/urls.py                        (URL routes for new views)
  - sv_pdl/views.py                       (morpheus_local, openapi_json,
                                           swagger_ui, licenses views;
                                           removed dead-code proxies)
  - sv_pdl/templates/site_base.html       (swapped 2 CDN <script> tags
                                           for local static; added
                                           {% load static %})
  - sv_pdl/templates/app.html             (swapped polyfill.io for local)
  - sv_pdl/templates/homepage.html        (added footer link block)
  - deploy/docker-compose.yml             (SCAIFE_BIND env for ports)
  - static/src/js/reader/widgets/WidgetPerseusDictionary.vue
  - static/src/js/reader/widgets/WidgetTokenList.vue
  - static/src/js/reader/widgets/WidgetWordList.vue
  - static/src/js/reader/widgets/NewAlexandriaWidget.vue

Downloaded third-party assets under `static/vendor/`:
  - jquery.min.js                                       (jQuery — MIT)
  - polyfill.min.js                                     (Financial Times — MIT)
  - swagger-ui/*                                        (Apache 2.0)
NOT covered by the MIT grant above — see each upstream project.

